---
// src/components/WhyChooseUs.astro
---
<section class="py-24 bg-white border-b border-brand-100 scroll-mt-16">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    
    <div class="text-center mb-16">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-black text-brand-950 mb-4 tracking-tight">Enterprise-Grade Advantages</h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-brand-800 max-w-2xl mx-auto font-medium">Why global distributors and institutional caterers choose EcoLyf Bagasse tableware.</p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
      
      <div class="flex flex-col items-center p-8 bg-brand-50 rounded-2xl border border-brand-100 hover:border-brand-300 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 text-center group">
        <div class="p-4 bg-white rounded-full mb-6 shadow-sm border border-brand-100 group-hover:shadow-md group-hover:border-brand-200 transition-all duration-300">
          <img src="/icons/lifecycle/biodegradable.png" alt="Plant on Hand Icon" class="w-14 h-14 object-contain group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300" />
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-brand-950 text-lg mb-2">100% Biodegradable</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-brand-800 leading-relaxed font-medium">Naturally composts within 60-90 days, leaving zero toxic residue in the environment.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="flex flex-col items-center p-8 bg-brand-50 rounded-2xl border border-brand-100 hover:border-brand-300 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 text-center group">
        <div class="p-4 bg-white rounded-full mb-6 shadow-sm border border-brand-100 group-hover:shadow-md group-hover:border-brand-200 transition-all duration-300">
          <img src="/icons/lifecycle/eco-friendly.png" alt="Eco Friendly Globe Icon" class="w-14 h-14 object-contain group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300" />
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-brand-950 text-lg mb-2">100% Eco Friendly</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-brand-800 leading-relaxed font-medium">Manufactured from renewable sugarcane fiber, minimizing carbon footprint and agricultural waste.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="flex flex-col items-center p-8 bg-brand-50 rounded-2xl border border-brand-100 hover:border-brand-300 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 text-center group">
        <div class="p-4 bg-white rounded-full mb-6 shadow-sm border border-brand-100 group-hover:shadow-md group-hover:border-brand-200 transition-all duration-300">
          <img src="/icons/lifecycle/microwave-safe.png" alt="Microwave with Food Icon" class="w-14 h-14 object-contain group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300" />
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-brand-950 text-lg mb-2">Microwave Safe</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-brand-800 leading-relaxed font-medium">Engineered to handle high temperatures (up to 120°C) without losing structural integrity or leaking.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="flex flex-col items-center p-8 bg-brand-50 rounded-2xl border border-brand-100 hover:border-brand-300 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 text-center group">
        <div class="p-4 bg-white rounded-full mb-6 shadow-sm border border-brand-100 group-hover:shadow-md group-hover:border-brand-200 transition-all duration-300">
          <img src="/icons/lifecycle/snowflake.png" alt="Freezer Ice Icon" class="w-14 h-14 object-contain group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300" />
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-brand-950 text-lg mb-2">Freeze Safe</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-brand-800 leading-relaxed font-medium">Capable of withstanding cold storage and freezing conditions without becoming brittle or cracking.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="flex flex-col items-center p-8 bg-brand-50 rounded-2xl border border-brand-100 hover:border-brand-300 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 text-center group">
        <div class="p-4 bg-white rounded-full mb-6 shadow-sm border border-brand-100 group-hover:shadow-md group-hover:border-brand-200 transition-all duration-300">
          <img src="/icons/lifecycle/non-toxic.png" alt="Non-Toxic Lab Bottle Icon" class="w-14 h-14 object-contain group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300" />
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-brand-950 text-lg mb-2">Non-Toxic Certified</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-brand-800 leading-relaxed font-medium">Strictly manufactured without PFAS forever chemicals, plastic liners, or harmful bleaching agents.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="flex flex-col items-center p-8 bg-brand-50 rounded-2xl border border-brand-100 hover:border-brand-300 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 text-center group">
        <div class="p-4 bg-white rounded-full mb-6 shadow-sm border border-brand-100 group-hover:shadow-md group-hover:border-brand-200 transition-all duration-300">
          <img src="/icons/lifecycle/export.png" alt="Flight around Globe Icon" class="w-14 h-14 object-contain group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300" />
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-brand-950 text-lg mb-2">Global Export Certified</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-brand-800 leading-relaxed font-medium">Fully compliant with international customs, SGS, FDA, and global food safety standards.</p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>